(Regression test for bug #68: the format hole's tag dispatch must cover
 every tag a slot can carry, not just the ones the headline repro used.
 A list holding one of each kind reads back through a hole and through the
 statement form, and the two must agree for all seven.

 Acceptance: number, text, decimal, boolean, nested list, map and nothing
 each render the same in a hole as they do printed directly.)

a list called 'one of each kind' is [1, "two", 3.5, yes, [6, 7], {"k": 8}, nothing].

Print "{element 1 of 'one of each kind'}".
Print element 1 of 'one of each kind'.
